  "_comment": "Drives doc/cheatsheet rendering on the site (site/build-site.js). category = which group the sheet appears under; tier = FAANG interview weight (5 = must-know .. 2 = niche); kind = 'sheet' (default), 'reference' (imported index, not a taught doc) or 'stub' (redirect). Titles come from each file's markdown H1 unless overridden here. Descriptions come from the file's `> **Scope**` line. Every .md in doc/cheatsheet (except 00_template.md) must appear in `sheets` or the build fails.",

  "tierLabels": {
    "5": { "label": "Must know", "note": "Shows up in almost every FAANG loop — you should be able to write these from memory." },
    "4": { "label": "High value", "note": "Common enough that a gap here costs you rounds." },
    "3": { "label": "Worth knowing", "note": "Appears regularly, usually as a variant of a tier-5 pattern." },
    "2": { "label": "Niche", "note": "Rare in interviews — read once, revisit only if a target company is known to ask." }
  },

